# Atelier Architecture Diagrams

Tools: `list_repos`, `get_diagram`, `open_viewer`, `patch_diagram`, `write_module_doc`.

**Any `repo_id` works dynamically:**
- Hosted repos load from `ATELIER_DATA_ORIGIN` (default `https://app.atelier-inc.net`)
- Local-only repos load from `ATELIER_LOCAL_REPO_ROOT` if set (folder of repo subdirs each with `overview.json`)
- Cached repos reuse `~/.cache/atelier-mcp/repos/{repo_id}/` unless `open_viewer(..., refresh=true)`

**Do not patch demo/production repos for testing.** Use local-only repos under `ATELIER_LOCAL_REPO_ROOT` (e.g. `minirepo`).

Workflow: `open_viewer(repo_id)` → `patch_diagram(repo_id, operations)` → viewer hot-reloads via `viewer_epoch.json`.
